flint 3.4: under emscripten (__unix__, neither Linux nor macOS), the
memory usage of print_memory_usage took the BSD branch (sysctl,
kinfo_proc): only getrusage's peak, as on the other systems.
--- a/src/generic_files/profiler.c
+++ b/src/generic_files/profiler.c
@@
 #elif defined(__APPLE__)
 # include <mach/mach.h>
 # include <sys/resource.h>
+#elif defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__)
+# include <sys/resource.h>
 #endif
@@
-# else /* BSD */
+# elif !defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__) /* BSD */
